        "zh": {
          "title": "芝加哥奧黑爾機場（ORD） E 候機廊動工 規劃新增 24 座登機門",
          "summary": "工程預算為9.17億美元。芝加哥市規劃2030年完成首期14座登機門，2034年擴增至24座。",
          "body": [
            "芝加哥市政府11月17日宣佈，奧黑爾國際機場新 E 候機廊正式動工。工程分兩期，預算合計9.17億美元，規劃新增24座登機門。",
            "首期預算6.4億美元，目標2030年完工，將提供14座可供國內航班使用的登機門，並透過地下通道與新 D 候機廊相連。市方預計先於2033年底完成全球航廈，再於2034年完成第二期的10座登機門。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Chicago O’Hare breaks ground on 24-gate Concourse E",
          "summary": "The $917 million project is planned in two phases, with the first 14 gates targeted for 2030 and all 24 for 2034.",
          "body": [
            "Chicago announced on November 17 that construction had begun on the new Concourse E at O’Hare International Airport. The $917 million project will add 24 gates in two phases.",
            "The $640 million first phase is targeted for completion in 2030 and will add 14 domestic-capable gates. An underground passenger tunnel will connect it to the new Concourse D. The city expects the remaining 10 gates in 2034, after the planned late-2033 completion of the Global Terminal."
          ]
        },
