        "zh": {
          "title": "西雅圖機場（SEA）登機空橋發生移民執法行動 阿拉斯加航空航班延誤",
          "summary": "美國移民暨海關執法局在阿拉斯加航空飛往洛杉磯的航班登機時拘留兩名旅客。西雅圖港務局正與聯邦機關確認執法程序。",
          "body": [
            "西雅圖港務局表示，11月21日上午，阿拉斯加航空 AS1306 航班在西雅圖－塔科馬國際機場辦理登機時，美國移民暨海關執法局（ICE）在登機空橋拘留兩名旅客。這班飛往洛杉磯的航班因此延誤。",
            "美聯社引述阿拉斯加航空表示，航空公司事前未收到通知，已向有關單位反映。西雅圖港務局也表示，港務局未參與行動，正與美國國土安全部確認是否遵守先前商定的機場執法程序。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Alaska Airlines flight delayed after immigration arrests on Seattle jet bridge",
          "summary": "Immigration officers detained two passengers during boarding for a Los Angeles-bound flight. The Port of Seattle is checking whether agreed procedures were followed.",
          "body": [
            "The Port of Seattle said U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement detained two passengers on November 21 as travelers boarded Alaska Airlines Flight AS1306 at Seattle–Tacoma International Airport. The arrests took place on the jet bridge and the Los Angeles-bound flight was delayed.",
            "Alaska Airlines told the Associated Press it had received no advance notice and had raised its concerns with the authorities. The Port said it did not participate in the action and was speaking with the Department of Homeland Security about whether previously agreed airport protocols were followed."
          ]
        },
